{
  "name": "Example: call the Instagram Reels Publisher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "eedfcb66-9d30-4152-a86c-780b449a1022",
      "name": "Run Example",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"sample_video_url\": \"https://your-site.example.com/videos/sample-reel.mp4\",\n  \"caption\": \"This week on the menu: Grilled Chicken Wrap and Lemon Tart.\\n\\n#foodie #lunch\",\n  \"also_story\": true\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "42a154ee-73fe-4219-85fe-c5e868667573",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.sample_video_url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "064fe7da-3083-4afa-a7a5-5a85cc4ab92a",
      "name": "Download Sample Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1db2218e-6ed6-4376-94fc-d3efbdc4d9de",
              "name": "caption",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.caption }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ebe2ee8a-8028-450c-9f61-73adc71cf2f7",
              "name": "share_to_feed",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "092dc143-9770-4334-ae0c-7d9ca6cd2791",
              "name": "also_story",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.also_story }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {
          "stripBinary": false
        }
      },
      "id": "a9a8e29b-9d5c-4fc7-9987-b43d5f3586b7",
      "name": "Add Publish Options",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "mode": "once",
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "b81689c3-3ecb-4995-b5f2-2c608ed97ef4",
      "name": "Publish via Reels Publisher",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example caller\n1. Import **instagram-reels-publisher.json** first, set it up and publish it.\n2. In **Config** put a direct link to a vertical MP4 (9:16, 3 s - 15 min).\n3. In **Publish via Reels Publisher** pick the publisher workflow from the list.\n4. Run. The binary property `data` plus `caption` / `share_to_feed` / `also_story` are passed as-is (the publisher accepts all data). Output: `{ media_id, permalink, timestamp, story }`.\n\n**Add Publish Options** keeps the binary (`Strip Binary Data` = off). To publish several videos, put a *Loop Over Items* node before the call: one execution publishes one reel.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b6c1c9ee-72df-49d7-a5a9-0003e94f9f68",
      "name": "Note: Example",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -40
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run Example": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Sample Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Sample Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Add Publish Options",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Add Publish Options": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Publish via Reels Publisher",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "binaryMode": "separate"
  }
}
